text t_s357 "beats B2 (reported)"
text t_s358 "loses to B2 (reported)"
text t_s359 "mixed or ties B2 (reported)"
text t_s360 " |\n"
text t_s361 "# EXP-001 compression bridge: "
text t_s362 "DRY RUN (development data, not evidence)"
text t_s363 "report"
text t_s364 "\n\nEXP_001_COMPRESSION_BRIDGE = @BRIDGE@\n\nProfile sha256 "
text t_s365 ". Candidate manifest sha256 "
text t_s366 " (status "
text t_s367 "). Dataset "
text t_s368 "), payload "
text t_s369 ".\n\nCriteria: "
text t_s370 ".\n\n"
text t_s371 "## Group "
text t_s372 " (primary): seeds"
text t_s373 " (replication): seeds"
text t_s374 " crumbs, "
text t_s375 " events\n\nAll values in bits. T against B2; uncertainty = 95% crumb-bootstrap interval of T_ideal (T_A, T_B intervals are the same interval shifted).\n\n| candidate | L(M) | ideal bits | coder-A bits | coder-B bits | T_ideal | T_A | T_B | uncertainty | result |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|---|\n"
text t_s376 "\nEnvelope (two-sided, per file and per crumb, |overhead - 448| <= 64 + 0.001 N bits):\n\n"
text t_s377 "- "
text t_s378 ": overhead A "
text t_s379 " bits, B "
text t_s380 " bits over the group; units outside the band A "
text t_s381 ", B "
text t_s382 "; worst crumb margin A "
text t_s383 " bits\n"
text t_s384 "\nSpearman rho of the description-length order, ideal vs A "
text t_s385 ", ideal vs B "
text t_s386 " (reported only).\n\n"
text t_s387 "Reversals: "
text t_s388 " found, "
text t_s389 " explained by the coder envelope (detail in uncertainty.json).\n\nSensitivity (T against B0, B1, B3; L(M) byte-rounded and doubled; data-only gain; interval inflated x2.04) is in uncertainty.json; it is reported, not part of the verdict.\n\n## Report sections\n\n- Preregistration: calibration/preregistration/"
text t_s390 ".md and preregistration.json (sha256 in final_receipt.json freeze.preregistration_sha256).\n- Blinding: calibration/docs/BLINDING_PROTOCOL.md; overlap audit "
text t_s391 "not used (dry run)"
text t_s392 "PASS (overlap_audit.json)"
text t_s393 ".\n- Candidate freeze: candidate_manifest.json sha256 "
text t_s394 ", status "
text t_s395 ", frozen_at "
text t_s396 ", freeze commit C_f "
text t_s397 "NONE (dry run)"
text t_s398 ".\n- Model-cost accounting: L(M) = exact TYM0 bits (calibration/docs/MODEL_DESCRIPTION_ENCODING.md), re-checked against the manifest for every candidate.\n- Probability stream: one TPS1 per candidate and file, probability_root "
text t_s399 " (probability_streams/INDEX).\n- Ideal codelength: ideal_lengths.json (per file and per crumb, int64 ub).\n- Actual coder results: arithmetic/results.json, ans/results.json, encoded_artifacts/INDEX, decoder_receipts/; coding_root "
text t_s400 ".\n- Memorizer result: rows M_mem and M_mem_seed1 in the tables above (criterion S7, S9).\n- Independent verification: S8 = @S8@ (scorer_independent.json vs scorer_primary.json).\n- Uncertainty: uncertainty.json (calibration/docs/UNCERTAINTY_PROTOCOL.md).\n- Failures/deviations: calibration/docs/PROTOCOL_CONFORMANCE.md (D1-D9)"
text t_s401 "; DRY RUN on development data"
text t_s402 ".\n- Gate decision: EXP_001_COMPRESSION_BRIDGE = @BRIDGE@ (rule: prereg section 5a).\n\n@NOTES@\n"
